# Indian Garment Fabric Requirements

An open, approximate reference for how much fabric common Indian garments need.

It is meant for designers, tailors, students, boutique owners and developers building sizing, costing or e-commerce tools. The same data is available as JSON in [`data/requirements.json`](data/requirements.json).

Maintained with input from the team at [Paras Gallery Fabrics](https://parasgalleryfabrics.com/), a fabric retail and wholesale house in Lajpat Nagar, New Delhi.

> **Important:** these are rough estimates for an average adult size. Actual requirements depend on the design, size, fabric width, pattern direction, border placement and the tailor's cutting method. Always confirm with your tailor or pattern maker before buying.

